         <gmd:abstract>
            <gco:CharacterString>A 10m high resolution raster layer containing height information is generated for selected cities and urban areas as part of the Urban atlas suite of products. Height information is based on satellite information and derived datasets like the digital surface model, the digital terrain model and the normalized DSM.</gco:CharacterString>
         </gmd:abstract>
