            <gmd:LI_Lineage>
               <gmd:statement>
                  <gco:CharacterString>This product is generated based on satellite information acquired as close as possible to the defined reference year. Based on these images a digital surface model is generated. Afterwards a digital terrain model is derived from the DSM with different filter algorithms and the assistance of Urban Atlas 2012 datasets. The calculation of the normalized DSM is done by a simple subtraction of the DTM from the DSM. The final product is then clipped based on UA 2012 building blocks and fully quality controlled.</gco:CharacterString>
